stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Queued
  Queued --> Running : worker claims
  state Running {
    [*] --> Fetching
    Fetching --> Transforming
    Transforming --> Writing
    Writing --> [*]
  }
  Running --> Succeeded
  Running --> Failed : throws
  state retry <<choice>>
  Failed --> retry
  retry --> Queued : attempts < 3
  retry --> DeadLettered : attempts >= 3
  Succeeded --> [*]
  DeadLettered --> [*]
  note right of DeadLettered
    Surfaced in the integration
    health panel.
  end note
